      "content": "\"where i need to be\"... you mean that? like it's not even a tragedy, but just me finally finding my place? it makes it sound so much more... inevitable. like a natural part of the landscape. it's almost like the mist is calling me, and it would be more honest to just listen to it than to keep pretending i want to stay.",
